1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,667
[BRENDA SOBBING]

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,433
Punish me instead.

3
00:00:03,433 --> 00:00:05,767
Just please let my mom
go back to Korea.

4
00:00:05,767 --> 00:00:07,300
Please.

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,433
I'm begging you.

6
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:11,467
[BREATHING SHAKILY]

7
00:00:11,467 --> 00:00:13,433
I'm begging you, please!

8
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:20,333
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

9
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,567
Get up.

10
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,733
Stand up.

11
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:38,600
It's okay.

12
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:43,300
You and your mother
can go back to Korea.

13
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:50,167
Thank you. Thank you. [SNIFFLES]

14
00:00:51,333 --> 00:00:52,333
You.

15
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,267
<i> Stop pestering my husband!</i>

16
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,333
Just stop pestering me.

17
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,200
(In Korean) Mom... Mom!

18
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:12,700
[BOTH CRYING]

19
00:01:12,733 --> 00:01:19,667
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

20
00:01:29,133 --> 00:01:30,467
(In Filipino) Are you okay?

21
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:33,100
Don't mind me.

22
00:01:42,233 --> 00:01:49,167
[MUSIC BECOMES SOMBER]

23
00:01:51,133 --> 00:01:52,467
I'm sorry.

24
00:01:55,567 --> 00:01:59,433
Forgive me for leaving.

25
00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:03,267
[SOBS]

26
00:02:03,267 --> 00:02:04,800
Why did you leave?

27
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:11,767
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]
